Teaghrán ar: ['html'] déan: { <- (
		féin
		ionadaigh: ['&'] le: ['&amp;'],
		ionadaigh: ['<'] le: ['&lt;'],
		ionadaigh: ['>'] le: ['&gt;'],
		ionadaigh: ['"'] le: ['&quot;']
	).
}.

>> list := Liosta nua.

['Verbatim Syntax'] carachtair gach: { :uimhir :letter
	list ; ((['<li>#Number:Letter</li>']) Number: (uimhir), Letter: letter).
}.

Aschur list.





>> template := ['
<html>
<body>
<p>Hello this is a test!</p>
<p>The string \‘Verbatim Syntax\’ has: 15 code points...</p>
<ul>
[list]
</ul>
</body> 
</html>
'] [list]: (list ceangail: ['↵']).

Aschur scríobh: template.

